        "original_id": "461ba48d-8bfe-5cd5-96ed-a7f3b6560292",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rodney Walker, Julius Shulman\n- Organizations: Sunset Publishing Corporation, Southern Progress Corporation, Time Warner\n- Products: Arts & Architecture, Better Homes and Gardens, Architectural Record, Sunset, Los Angeles Times Home\n- Places: Southern California, Western United States\n- Topics: Residential architecture, midcentury American modern design, magazine publishing\n\nFacts:\n- Rodney Walker was a midcentury American modern designer and builder who lived from 1910 to 1986 and specialized in residential architecture in Southern California.\n- Many Rodney Walker homes were photographed by Julius Shulman for Arts & Architecture, Better Homes and Gardens, Architectural Record, Sunset, and Los Angeles Times Home.\n- Sunset focuses on homes, cooking, gardening, and travel, with an almost exclusive focus on the Western United States.\n- Sunset is published monthly by the Sunset Publishing Corporation, which is part of Southern Progress Corporation, a subsidiary of Time Warner.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
